OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cold frosty start leading to
OL,6,Fa dry day with largely clear skies and
OL,7,Flots of sunshine. Some patchy cloud
OL,8,Fnear the east coast but still bright
OL,9,For sunny spells. Breezy northerly
OL,10,Fwinds near the coasts.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FIt will be a dry evening with
OL,13,Flargely clear skies, cloudier near
OL,14,Feastern coasts. Turning cloudier
OL,15,Facross all parts overnight but still
OL,16,Fclear spells. Cold and frosty.
OL,17,
OL,18,CFriday:FMostly cloudy with some bright
OL,19,Fintervals and a few showers in the
OL,20,Fwest. The east will be dry with longer
OL,21,Fbright or sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
